        <mxCell id="BYu-hgFbEyBvTlWawLu1-99" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="&lt;p data-start=&quot;1129&quot; data-end=&quot;1152&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot;&gt;Agar interviewer puche:&lt;span aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchor&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;blockquote data-start=&quot;1154&quot; data-end=&quot;1223&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1156&quot; data-end=&quot;1223&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1156&quot; data-end=&quot;1223&quot;&gt;How can you speed up &lt;code data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1195&quot;&gt;terraform init&lt;/code&gt; across multiple projects?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1232&quot;&gt;Answer:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;blockquote data-start=&quot;1234&quot; data-end=&quot;1504&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1236&quot; data-end=&quot;1504&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1236&quot; data-end=&quot;1504&quot;&gt;We can configure the &lt;code data-start=&quot;1259&quot; data-end=&quot;1280&quot;&gt;TF_PLUGIN_CACHE_DIR&lt;/code&gt; environment variable. Terraform stores downloaded provider plugins in a shared cache directory, so future &lt;code data-start=&quot;1387&quot; data-end=&quot;1403&quot;&gt;terraform init&lt;/code&gt; commands reuse the cached plugins instead of downloading them again, reducing initialization time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="340" width="560" x="-820" y="11060" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
