        <mxCell id="o667PHzVvcjDVYQr-MMa-114" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;verticalAlign=top;" value="&amp;nbsp;immediately compromised maan ke revoke/rotate karna chahiye.&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Pehle secret revoke/rotate karo&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Azure Service Principal → Client Secret → new secret create karo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Purana secret immediately delete/revoke karo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Agar PAT leak hua hai → PAT revoke karke new PAT banao.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Agar Azure Storage Account key leak hui → key rotate karo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Agar password/API key hai → provider ke portal se rotate karo.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. git hub m jo mere old secrets h unko delete kr dete h&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. New secret ko GitHub Secrets mein update karo&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. secrets scanning enable kr dete - gitleaks,truggle hog,tFsec - security misconfiguration k liye , TF lint - validate ka advance version h&amp;nbsp; , checkov - vunebility&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;if a secrert accidently pused in to git , i immediately revoke or rotate the credential&#39;s.then i remove the secrests from source code and rewirte the git history to eliminate the exposed credetainls.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;after that i will use the secrets scaaing tool like gitleaks , trugffle to make sure the hardcode secrets are not in the respository.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;for future prevention we always use azure key vault and git hub secrets, variables&amp;nbsp; to run the pipeline.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="340" width="520" x="-1280" y="35640" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
