        <mxCell id="G0Dou9oEb0EDADHKUUAy-59" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" value="&quot;First, I would check whether Blob Soft Delete and versioning are enabled. If soft delete is disabled, deleting the blob permanently removes it. If soft delete is enabled, a normal delete only makes the blob recoverable during the retention period. For permanent removal, I would purge the soft-deleted blob and also remove any retained versions or snapshots if versioning is enabled.&quot;" vertex="1">
